OL,3,GNEWSA'My grandad used to tell me the
OL,4,Aflashing lights meant the Martians were
OL,5,Acoming'
OL,6,
OL,7,FJenna still remembers standing beside
OL,8,Fthe lake at Walsall Illuminations as a
OL,9,Fchild, watching colourful displays
OL,10,Freflected in the water while clutching
OL,11,Fa balloon.
OL,13,F"My grandad used to tell me the
OL,14,Fflashing lights meant the Martians were
OL,15,Fcoming," she laughed.
OL,17,FFor generations of Black Country
OL,18,Ffamilies, a trip to the annual
OL,19,Fspectacle at Walsall Arboretum was as
OL,20,Fmuch a part of autumn as fireworks and
OL,21,Ffalling leaves.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
