OL,3,GNEWSA'My grandad used to tell me the
OL,4,Aflashing lights meant the Martians were
OL,5,Acoming'
OL,6,
OL,7,FSo when Walsall Council revealed this
OL,8,Fweek that it was exploring bringing the
OL,9,Fattraction back, memories came flooding
OL,10,Fback for people who grew up with
OL,11,Filluminated pirates, giant robots and
OL,12,Flaser shows.
